=== 1. Code Inspection of scripts/test-atomic-install.sh

Freebuff applied the two hunks proposed in `docs/logs/r6-stage14-flake-2026-10-17.log` section 10:
- Added `poll_for_marker()` helper (lines 70-82):
  Runs until `NOVA_BOOT_OK` appears in serial log `$LOG` (polled every 50 ms via `sleep 0.05`)
  or until `$waited >= $CAP_MS` (30,000 ms), then kills and waits on QEMU `$pid`.
- In `boot_check()` (lines 84-109):
  Replaced fixed `timeout 12 "$QEMU_BIN" ...` with `CAP_MS=30000`, running QEMU in the
  background (`&`), storing `$!`, invoking `poll_for_marker "$qpid"`, and verifying
  `grep -q "NOVA_BOOT_OK" "$LOG"`.
- In `boot_fail_expected()` (lines 111-130):
  Applied the identical 30 s cap background QEMU execution with `poll_for_marker "$qpid"`,
  confirming that a sabotaged image does NOT reach `NOVA_BOOT_OK`. If `NOVA_BOOT_OK` is found,
  it fails loudly: `SABOTAGE GATE FAIL ($name): mutant image BOOTED - the suite is decorative`.

